      "created_at": "2018-08-08T05:05:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For La Comandora, can anyone explain to me the use for the SoT effect on the card Shipshape? I must be missing something because I’m not sure how that would ever be helpful or have any point. Any ongoings you put back into play would then require an additional discard for no other gain. Or you get rid of Shipshape mid effect and it clogs your deck. The first effect is great, but is there an obvious internal deck synergy I’m missing?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On Medico, I’m curious about how the interactions work between his base Clinical Consult power and the card Second Opinion. Let’s say one other target has the Consult buff while Second Opinion is in play and Medico heals that target for 1 HP. Consult increases this to 3 HP which triggers Second Opinions option. Let’s now say that the other hero chooses to use the power and not regain the health. Does that target continue to have the Consult buff since no HP was regained? Does the Consult buff get swallowed to trigger Second Opinion? Would Second Opinion trigger at all due to me misplaying Consult be a possibility?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for your help guys.&nbsp;</p>",
