      "created_at": "2018-08-08T14:23:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, because you wouldn’t have regained a total of 3 HP to trigger Second Opinion without it. &nbsp;I can see your point and I can bring it up but I’ve certainly have played with it being expended by choosing to use a power&nbsp;</p>",
