    {
      "id": 221107,
      "name": "Dandolo",
      "username": "Dandolo",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-08T15:46:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was the one pushing for the Shipshape effect in playtesting.</p>\n<p>The primary benefit I see is it let’s you set-up La Comodora using Weigh Anchor and Harnessed Anomaly without worrying that you won’t have a way to get your end of turn effects in the order you want.</p>\n<p>In practice I tend to use the effect in 3 primary ways:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>To recall Paradoja Figurehead to my play area so I can get the damage boost and also give it to another.</li>\n<li>To swap the order of Timeless Treasure and Chronological Sweetspot so that you can use your base power on another hero and give them a draw before your end of turn phase.</li>\n<li>To move Brig Teleporter after Cannon Portal so you can get a target down to 6 or less HP before you hit it with Brig Teleporter.</li>\n</ol>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:42.743Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 18340,
      "topic_slug": "rules-deck-questions-comandora-and-medico",
      "display_username": "Dandolo",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I was the one pushing for the Shipshape effect in playtesting.\r\n\r\nThe primary benefit I see is it let's you set-up La Comodora using Weigh Anchor and Harnessed Anomaly without worrying that you won't have a way to get your end of turn effects in the order you want.\r\n\r\nIn practice I tend to use the effect in 3 primary ways:\r\n1. To recall Paradoja Figurehead to my play area so I can get the damage boost and also give it to another.\r\n2. To swap the order of Timeless Treasure and Chronological Sweetspot so that you can use your base power on another hero and give them a draw before your end of turn phase.\r\n3. To move Brig Teleporter after Cannon Portal so you can get a target down to 6 or less HP before you hit it with Brig Teleporter.",
