      "created_at": "2018-08-08T16:28:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, because you wouldn’t have regained a total of 3 HP to trigger Second Opinion without it. &nbsp;I can see your point and I can bring it up but I’ve certainly have played with it being expended by choosing to use a power&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>for the record, this is the way I table ruled it in game when the question arose. It felt like the correct way to do it, but I wanted to be sure I wasn’t intentionally gimping medicos strength.&nbsp;</p>",
